data_eigenspectra: eigenspectra of galaxies, quasars and stars from SDSS (DR8, DR17) and DESI DR2
=================================================================================================

Written by the Galaxy Template thread, 2026-11-02 (Nao: "describe what you've done so far with dates").
Only released bases and their build iterations are committed here (a few MB each); stacks, per-galaxy tables and
work-in-progress bases live under ~/data/ and /Volumes/exdisk3/ and are not in git. The detailed recipes are in
HANDOVER.md (galaxies, 2026-10-28), STARS.md, docs/HANDOVER_normalization.md and docs/PLAN_telluric.md; the paper is
~/github/papers/26_sdssdesi_spectra/ms.tex.

File naming: <class>_eigenspectra_v<N>.fits counts released bases; <class>_empca_<inputs>_v<N>.fits are build iterations.
Format (all classes): EIGVEC [nvec, npix] (row 0 = the mean shape), COEFF [nstack, nvec], PIXMASK, VARIANCE, WAVE
(rest, vacuum, log10 grid with dlog = 1e-4, i.e. 69 km/s pixels), CELLS (the stacks' cell table). Galaxy bases from
release 3 on also carry EIGVEC_ORTHO / COEFF_ORTHO (the orthonormal EM-PCA basis) and the header keys REF_LO / REF_HI.


